    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.6741943359375,
        526.1677856445312,
        447.9142150878906
      ],
      "text": "Any symptom of TB: cough, haemoptysis, fever, night sweats, weight loss, chest pain, shortness of breath, fatigue. An HIV test could  a",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        447.6741943359375,
        526.2598876953125,
        457.9142150878906
      ],
      "text": "be offered according to national or local guidelines or clinical judgement. Similarly, chest radiographs could be performed at this",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        457.6741943359375,
        101.18900299072266,
        467.9142150878906
      ],
      "text": "stage.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.6741943359375,
        526.270751953125,
        477.9142150878906
      ],
      "text": "Clients for whom LTBI treatment is not indicated should be given information about TB, including the importance of seeking care if  b",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        477.6741943359375,
        167.9897918701172,
        487.9142150878906
      ],
      "text": "symptoms of TB develop.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        487.6741943359375,
        526.2630615234375,
        497.9142150878906
      ],
      "text": "National TB guidelines should be followed in investigating TB. In addition, people in whom TB is excluded after investigations  c",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        80.78739929199219,
        497.6741943359375,
        378.4186706542969,
        507.9142150878906
      ],
      "text": "(including those with fibrotic radiological lesions) can be considered for LTBI treatment.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        536.2266235351562,
        526.6760864257812,
        549.026611328125
      ],
      "text": "The GDG also noted that symptom screening with or without the addition of chest radiography should be",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        550.2266235351562,
        526.6571655273438,
        563.026611328125
      ],
      "text": "acceptable for individuals and programme managers. Chest radiography could increase the confidence of",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        564.2266235351562,
        526.6033325195312,
        577.026611328125
      ],
      "text": "health care providers that active TB has been ruled out, thus reducing any concern about development of drug",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        578.2266235351562,
        526.6723022460938,
        591.026611328125
      ],
      "text": "resistance; however, addition of chest radiography could incur costs for clients and inconvenience, as more",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        592.2266235351562,
        526.7122192382812,
        605.026611328125
      ],
      "text": "clients would have to be investigated for TB and other diseases. The GDG noted the difficulty of assessing the",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        606.2266235351562,
        356.1991882324219,
        619.026611328125
      ],
      "text": "preferences of children, which were not systematically documented.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        634.1854248046875,
        298.9588317871094,
        650.9684448242188
      ],
      "text": "3.3\t Considerations for implementation",
      "font": "Whitney-Semibold",
      "size": 13.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        656.9036865234375,
        526.6561889648438,
        669.7036743164062
      ],
      "text": "Addition of abnormal chest radiographic findings to the symptom screening rule would complicate logistics,",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        670.9036865234375,
        526.6752319335938,
        683.7036743164062
      ],
      "text": "increasing the cost, workload, infrastructure and availability of qualified staff. The GDG noted that chest",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        684.9036865234375,
        526.6559448242188,
        697.7036743164062
      ],
      "text": "radiography should not be a requirement or a barrier for initiating TB preventive treatment in people living",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        698.9036865234375,
        526.604248046875,
        711.7036743164062
      ],
      "text": "with HIV because of the need for additional resources, in view of the marginal gain in negative predictive value.",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        718.57373046875,
        526.7061767578125,
        731.3737182617188
      ],
      "text": "People living with HIV who have any of the four symptoms or abnormal chest radiographic findings may have",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        732.57373046875,
        526.71337890625,
        745.3737182617188
      ],
      "text": "active TB and should be investigated for TB and other diseases. Xpert MTB/RIF should be used as the initial",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        746.57373046875,
        526.6710205078125,
        759.3737182617188
      ],
      "text": "diagnostic test. Other diseases that cause any of the four symptoms should be investigated in accordance with",
      "font": "Whitney-Book",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        538.5827026367188,
